OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy and wet start with
OL,6,Fheavy spells of rain, clearing
OL,7,Feastwards during the day. Turning
OL,8,Fbrighter from the west during the
OL,9,Fafternoon with sunny spells and
OL,10,Fshowers following.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FFurther showers are likely
OL,13,Fduring the evening but turning drier
OL,14,Ffrom the west with clear spells.
OL,15,FIsolated showers are likely to persist
OL,16,Ffor much of the night, across high
OL,17,Fground.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
