OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FA cloudy start on Sunday with
OL,6,Fany sunny spells soon giving way to
OL,7,Fshowers, these locally heavy, with
OL,8,Fthunder and hail during the afternoon
OL,9,Fand evening. Temperatures close to
OL,10,Fnormal.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,13,FUnsettled throughout with showers,
OL,14,Fthese locally heavy and with thundery.
OL,15,FStaying warm to start with but turning
OL,16,Ffresher as winds shift to a westerly
OL,17,Fand strengthen from Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
